    "body": "Reopened as PR #3 after #2 was closed.\n\nNew GET /landing-page route serving a static landing page for pica. src/landing/view.ts renders static HTML matching the dashboard aesthetic (dark monospace, #0b0e11, #7fb3ff links), with copy from the README: pitch, learning-loop diagram, three panels, links to /dashboard and /why. src/landing/routes.ts registers landingPlugin (text/html, no auth — public, unlike dashboard/why). src/app.ts registers the plugin, README.md documents src/landing/ for the docs-reality test.\n\nNo controller layer — the static page has no state, and a pass-through controller would be the speculative abstraction plan.md bans. No root / alias — root stays 404.\n",
